{"code":"060560","name":"HC홈센타","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건축자재","sector_desc":"시멘트·창호·인테리어 자재 등. 주택 착공과 건설 경기를 후행해서 따라갑니다.","desc":"동사는 1988년 소방설비공사를 사업목적으로 설립되었으며, 2002년 코스닥시장에 상장, 2017년 지주회사로 전환하였음. 종속회사로 레미콘 제조 13개사, 아스콘 제조, 유류도매, 물류운송, 아파트건설업 등 계열사를 보유하고 있으며, 2024년 (주)에이치씨동화주택 인수로 건설업 영역을 확장하였음. 지주회사로서 건축자재 도소매업과 레저스포츠 및 근린생활시설 운영·임대업을 영위하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":1946.0,"open":1830.0,"high":1998.0,"low":1758.0,"volume":3643,"amount":7089278.0,"ret_1d":6.9231,"gap":0.5495,"range_pct":12.333,"ret_5":-0.5621,"ret_20":-2.1619,"ret_60":11.391,"ret_120":-44.4793,"ret_250":-44.4793,"ma20":1933.95,"ma60":1948.4,"ma120":2100.5917,"ma200":2732.705,"close_vs_ma200":-28.7885,"close_vs_ma60":-0.1232,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":4.0694,"r2_60":0.0065,"slope_120":-49.9581,"r2_120":0.3828,"slope_250":-58.2961,"r2_250":0.6958,"high52":4440.0,"low52":1682.0,"pos_52w":9.5722,"dd_52w":-56.1712,"mdd_1y":-59.815,"atr14_pct":8.3688,"vol_ann_60":41.822,"vol_avg20":34725.2,"vol_ratio20":0.1049,"vr5":0.2595,"vr20":0.8651,"amount_avg5":8623423.6,"amount_avg20":68192896.2,"amount_avg60":33980708.7833,"obv_chg20":29.8676,"turnover_20":2.7356,"pv_eff_20":-0.7903,"rsi14":50.8798,"frgn_net_5":-74.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0003,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0003,"frgn_net_20":-31102.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1225,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1225,"frgn_net_60":-24607.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0969,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0969,"frgn_net_120":-165218.0,"inst_net_120":-3.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.6508,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.6508,"foreign_ratio":1.6,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.12,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-20.0,"op_margin_q":-2.3502,"op_qoq":66.1017,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":33.3333,"rev_yoy":14.0751,"op_trend_4q":19.5652,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-21.88,"debt_ratio":149.13,"per":null,"pbr":0.37,"div_yield":2.57,"foreign_rate